    "ciesin:harvard_doi": "10.7910/DVN/U7MOCL",
    "ciesin:sedac_doi": "10.7927/H4BC3WMT",
    "ciesin:purpose": "To provide a vector (point) version of the input administrative units used in GPWv4 with population estimates, densities, 2010 basic demographic characteristics, and administrative name, area, and data context for use in data integration.",
    "ciesin:supplemental_info": "The documentation for this data set is available at http://sedac.ciesin.columbia.edu/data/set/gpw-v4-admin-unit-center-points-population-estimates-rev11/docs.",
